<title>USA: BTG completes 2.19 mln shr offering.</title>
<headline>BTG completes 2.19 mln shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTG Inc said on Wednesday it has completed a stock offering of 2.19 million shares at $16.25 a share.</p>
<p>The public offering also included 110,000 shares being sold by a selling shareholder, the company said.</p>
<p>The lead managing underwriter for the offering is Prudential Securities Inc, and the co-managing underwriters are Janney Montgomery Scott Inc and Ferris Baker Watts Inc, the company said.</p>
